== About ==
'''HAMMER''' is a [[Portuguese]] QuakeWorld player hailing from Madeira Island.
He began his journey in the game back in [[1998]].
<br />
Due to limited internet connectivity at the time, most of his early matches were confined to [[Portuguese]] servers.
He became less active around [[2002]] and eventually stepped away from the game in [[2007]], however, in March [[2018]] he made a notable return to the scene.
<br />
While not known for his dueling prowess, he still participates in [[1on1]] matches occasionally.
His true passion lies in team modes, particularly [[2on2]] and [[4on4]], where he truly thrives.
<br />
Today, he is regarded as one of the top [[4on4]] players on the map [[Schloss]].
<br />
Throughout his career, he remained loyal to a single clan, [[ROT]], and also managed it from [[2018]] until [[2025]]. Due to inactivity from team members, he eventually chose to part ways with the clan in that same year.
<br />
As a tournament organizer, he is known for his strict yet fair approach and is constantly seeking new ways to enhance the competitive landscape of QuakeWorld.

